        "Id": "4ba46f8a-677f-4856-999b-2e4ed42b375b",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Hot Tub Massacre",
        "Location": "LOCATION_OPULENT_STINGRAY",
        "PublicId": "126367190443",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository cee4e428-1efb-42ef-8eb5-763822781738).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening Mungalungadingus,\r\rHaven Resort management has requested us to eliminate three guests. They have been leaving seafood in the hot tub, and other guests have started to complain. However they can&apos;t just kick them off the island as they all have blackmail on those in higher management on the island. So, the Resort has requested we eliminate them in a way that seems accidental. Do be careful as Chaos Agent is also around for another job, so do not harm them in any way.\r\rGood Luck, Munga",
